---
import { AFFILIATES_ENABLED, withBase } from '../consts';
---
<aside class="note">
  <strong>Affiliate disclosure</strong>
  {AFFILIATES_ENABLED ? (
    <p>
      Some links on this page are affiliate links. If you buy through one we may earn a
      commission, at no extra cost to you. It does not change what we recommend. Our
      <a href={withBase('/editorial-policy/')}> editorial policy</a> explains how we keep
      those two things apart.
    </p>
  ) : (
    <p>
      This page has no affiliate links and earns us nothing. The site is not monetised yet.
      If that changes, every page with a paid link will say so here, above the content it
      applies to. Our <a href={withBase('/affiliate-disclosure/')}>disclosure policy</a> is
      already written.
    </p>
  )}
</aside>
